@host = http://localhost:5006
@customerId = aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa

### ─── SORGULAR (Read) ───────────────────────────────────────────

### Ürünler (Products tablosu Dapper ile salt-okunur)
GET {{host}}/products

### ─── KOMUTLAR (Write) ──────────────────────────────────────────

### PlaceOrderCommand → 201 + { id }
# @name placeOrder
POST {{host}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "{{customerId}}",
  "items": [
    { "productId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111", "quantity": 2 },
    { "productId": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222", "quantity": 1 }
  ]
}

### HEMEN çalıştırın → büyük ihtimalle 404 (projeksiyon 500ms gecikmeli)
GET {{host}}/orders/{{placeOrder.response.body.$.id}}

### 1 sn sonra tekrar → 200, OrderSummaries satırı
GET {{host}}/orders/{{placeOrder.response.body.$.id}}

### Müşterinin siparişleri (OrderSummaries)
GET {{host}}/customers/{{customerId}}/orders

### Müşteri istatistikleri (CustomerStats)
GET {{host}}/customers/{{customerId}}/stats

### ShipOrderCommand → 204
POST {{host}}/orders/{{placeOrder.response.body.$.id}}/ship

### CancelOrderCommand → kargolanmış sipariş: 409
POST {{host}}/orders/{{placeOrder.response.body.$.id}}/cancel

### Geçersiz komut → 400
POST {{host}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerId": "{{customerId}}", "items": [] }
